    "detailed_description": "Time's Prison is a first-person game. It is a game of searching for treasure on a deserted island by passing various adventure and puzzle tracks. It is the first game of Haldur game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA pirate who is burning with love for treasure finally finds the treasure island on the map.<br />\r\nWhile approaching the island with his boat, a cannonball that suddenly comes sinks his boat. The pirate ship swims towards the island while it is near the island.<br />\r\nHowever, the pirate has puzzles to solve and adventures to go through. The story of the game starts right here.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are two ghosts on the island. These ghosts show that the island is cursed. It is a very dangerous and cursed island for the pirate.<br />\r\nHe tries to reach the treasure by moving forward on this island and passing through difficult paths in search of the treasure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game was made by two people in our spare time in two months. It is the first activity of our company.<br />\r\nWe would be happy to see your positive opinions about our game in your comments.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThank you.",
